{"4713190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crown Of Blight", "steam_appid": 4713190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crown of Blight</strong> is a dark 3D top-down metroidvania. You play as the Church’s elite Hunter, sent to a ruined dungeon to stop a deadly infection called the Blight. This corruption is spreading fast, and you are the only one who can find its source.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Underground:</strong> Travel through a connected world full of secrets, shortcuts, and dangerous traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast and Brutal Combat:</strong> Fight against scary monsters and powerful bosses. You will need quick reflexes to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the Truth:</strong> The Blight is not just a mere corruption. it is the very embodiment of dark magic. Follow the trails of a warped reality to face the one who stands behind this disaster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up and Evolve:</strong> Defeat enemies to gain experience and level up. Unlock new talents and abilities to grow stronger and reach areas that were previously closed to you.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crown of Blight</strong> is a dark 3D top-down metroidvania. You play as the Church’s elite Hunter, sent to a ruined dungeon to stop a deadly infection called the Blight. This corruption is spreading fast, and you are the only one who can find its source.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Underground:</strong> Travel through a connected world full of secrets, shortcuts, and dangerous traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast and Brutal Combat:</strong> Fight against scary monsters and powerful bosses. You will need quick reflexes to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the Truth:</strong> The Blight is not just a mere corruption. it is the very embodiment of dark magic. Follow the trails of a warped reality to face the one who stands behind this disaster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up and Evolve:</strong> Defeat enemies to gain experience and level up. Unlock new talents and abilities to grow stronger and reach areas that were previously closed to you.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Crown of Blight is a dynamic top-down 3D metroidvania. As an elite Hunter of the Church, descend into cursed dungeons to find the source of the Blight. Annihilate hordes of enemies, unlock new paths, and uncover the grim truth hidden in the depths.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Ukrainian, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713190/41e136b5846ae310aaf5d265e375967416b3fbd3/header.jpg?t=1784837592", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713190/731b83c01ffd223fc4fc0277f8cd0c7eeb13d57b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784837592", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713190/731b83c01ffd223fc4fc0277f8cd0c7eeb13d57b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784837592", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recomm